 "body_html": "<h2>Cómo se hace</h2><p>Para sumar o restar decenas, solo cambia la cifra de las decenas: 340 + 20 = 360.</p><p>Con centenas, solo cambian las centenas: 450 + 300 = 750.</p><p>Para sumar 9, suma 10 y quita 1. Para sumar 11, suma 10 y suma 1.</p><p>Para completar: 37 + 3 = 40, porque 7 + 3 = 10.</p><div class='qfig'><svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 128 102' width='128' height='102' role='img' aria-label='4 decenas y 6 unidades'><g font-family='Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif'><rect x='6' y='6' width='11' height='90' fill='#cfe6d6' stroke='#006633' stroke-width='1.6'/><line x1='6' y1='15' x2='17' y2='15' stroke='#006633' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='6' y1='24' x2='17' y2='24' stroke='#006633' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='6' y1='33' x2='17' y2='33' stroke='#006633' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='6' y1='42' x2='17' y2='42' stroke='#006633' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='6' y1='51' x2='17' y2='51' stroke='#006633' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='6' y1='60' x2='17' y2='60' stroke='#006633' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='6' y1='69' x2='17' y2='69' stroke='#006633' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='6' y1='78' x2='17' y2='78' stroke='#006633' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='6' y1='87' x2='17' y2='87' stroke='#006633' stroke-width='0.8'/><rect x='25' y='6' width='11' height='90' fill='#cfe6d6' stroke='#006633' stroke-width='1.6'/><line x1='25' y1='15' x2='36' y2='15' stroke='#006633' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='25' y1='24' x2='36' y2='24' stroke='#006633' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='25' y1='33' x2='36' y2='33' stroke='#006633' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='25' y1='42' x2='36' y2='42' stroke='#006633' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='25' y1='51' x2='36' y2='51' stroke='#006633' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='25' y1='60' x2='36' y2='60' stroke='#006633' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='25' y1='69' x2='36' y2='69' stroke='#006633' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='25' y1='78' x2='36' y2='78' stroke='#006633' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='25' y1='87' x2='36' y2='8